  "_comment": [
    "The category board: each category is a column of five questions, easiest",
    "first. kind says where the wrong answers come from — person and place",
    "draw from the people and places files, book from the books of the Bible —",
    "so the answer must be spelled the way that file spells it. kind other",
    "means nothing on file fits, and the author writes the wrong answers:",
    "eight, most plausible first, so a replay does not show the same four.",
    "",
    "Factual, not interpretive. A question the text itself settles, never one a",
    "commentary does. Keep the answer out of the prompt: the check warns when a",
    "prompt names its own answer."
